{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:03e476aa101a7832","name":"ThrillSpace Travel","source":{"id":"source:reference-03e476aa101a7832","title":"ThrillSpace Travel","revision":23395,"timestamp":"2024-09-25T16:34:10Z","sha256":"318fa998602b536b38e897cb44b2acfed49c99a1a7ecd7c91b95e3b5e44f8099","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=23395","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=ThrillSpace%20Travel&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-03e476aa101a7832","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Many heroes are made in the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kashyyyk"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kashyyyk","referenceId":"reference:0886d73261c13472"},". A young ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiee"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiee","referenceId":"reference:0ac15c44d33f4b95"}," named ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grabathar"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grabathar?action=edit&redlink=1"}," uses his status as a war hero to begin ThrillSpace Travel. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grabathar"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grabathar?action=edit&redlink=1"}," takes travelers on trips to exotic destinations throughout the galaxy. He offers prepackaged tours but also is available for chartering. Business has been booming since the end of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},", so ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grabathar"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grabathar?action=edit&redlink=1"}," has added other captains and ships into his operation and is on the lookout for more spacers with the ability to entertain as well as protect passengers.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
